            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa nama tanda <code>&gt;</code>?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item correct=\"true\" value=\"1\">Operator lebih besar dari</item><item correct=\"false\" value=\"2\">Operator lebih kecil dari</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Operator lebih besar dari.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Operator mana yang membuat <code>8 &gt; 3</code> menghasilkan <code>true</code>?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Operator lebih besar dari</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Operator lebih kecil dari</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Operator kesetaraan</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih Operator lebih besar dari.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 3",
            "id": 62759,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa yang ditampilkan kode ini di konsol?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" &lt; \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>false</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>true</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>false</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kamu menukar kedua angka dalam perbandingan. Apa yang kini ditampilkan console?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" &lt; \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>true</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>false</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>1</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>true</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 4",
            "id": 62760,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa yang ditampilkan kode ini di konsol?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" &gt; \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>false</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>true</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>false</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kamu mengganti <code>1</code> di sisi kiri dengan <code>2</code>. Apa yang kini ditampilkan perbandingan?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" &gt; \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>true</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>false</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>2</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>true</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example 1",
            "id": 62761,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Periksa apakah <code>5</code> lebih besar dari <code>4</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" &gt; \" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"13\" /><option startIndex=\"14\" endIndex=\"15\" /><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"17\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"===\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"true\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>5</code>, diikuti oleh <code>&gt;</code>, dan terakhir <code>4</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Periksa apakah <code>5</code> lebih besar daripada <code>4</code>, dengan <code>5</code> tetap di kiri.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" &gt; \" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"13\" /><option startIndex=\"14\" endIndex=\"15\" /><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"17\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"===\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"=\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"true\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>5</code>, diikuti oleh <code>&gt;</code>, dan terakhir <code>4</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
